* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.sqlite binary

# TypeScript sources are ALWAYS diffed as text. `text=auto` alone leaves the decision to git's
# content heuristic, so a single stray NUL byte silently turns a source file into an opaque
# "Binary files differ" — which is exactly how one survived several reviews in generate.ts.
*.ts text diff
*.tsx text diff
